    {
      "id": "b2",
      "function": "problem",
      "scene_type": "gb_load",
      "spoken": "Back then: in December 1879 the Tay Bridge collapsed. Work on the planned suspension bridge over the Forth was stopped, and in 1881 the plans were dropped.",
